/**
 * Kara, préfecture de la Kozah: a river town in the savanna hills of the north. The Kara
 * river crosses the grid from west to east with three bridges; the Lama hills close the
 * north-east; no ocean, no beach. Streets are looser than Lomé's, with the dense core
 * around the grand market and the préfecture.
 */
